==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.13~1 seconds<sup>4f~30f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6~33.33 seconds<sup>180f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6~66.67 seconds<sup>180f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~60 seconds<sup>400f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Hikaru Saotome (Enemy)|Hikaru Saotome]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

